  THE FOUR FREEDOMS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

You are GRANTED, IRREVOCABLY and FOR ALL TIME, the following freedoms:

  ◢ FREEDOM 0 ◣  The freedom to RUN this software, for any purpose,
                 commercial or non-commercial, public or private.

  ◢ FREEDOM 1 ◣  The freedom to STUDY how the software works, and to
                 MODIFY it to suit your needs. The full source is
                 yours — there are no obfuscated parts.

  ◢ FREEDOM 2 ◣  The freedom to REDISTRIBUTE copies, in any medium,
                 to anyone, anywhere, without asking permission.

  ◢ FREEDOM 3 ◣  The freedom to DISTRIBUTE MODIFIED VERSIONS, fork it,
                 strip it, rebrand it, sell it, give it away, mod it
                 into something completely different.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  THE PIRATE CODE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  1. NO WARRANTY. This software is provided "AS IS" — if it breaks,
     you keep both pieces. Don't sue. We're all pirates here.

  2. NO LIABILITY. The authors cannot be held responsible for any
     damage, data loss, financial loss, or existential dread caused
     by use, misuse, or non-use of this software.

  3. NO PATENT TRAPS. Contributors implicitly grant a patent license
     for any of their contributions. You can't contribute and then
     sue users for using your code.

  4. NO ATTRIBUTION REQUIRED — but appreciated. Mention RDWE if you
     fork it. Don't pretend you wrote it from scratch. The dragon
     remembers.

  5. NO DRM, NO TELEMETRY, NO PHONE-HOME — ever. If you fork this,
     don't add tracking. The freedom of the user is sacred.

  6. NO RESTRICTION ON USE. Run this on a server, on a yacht, on a
     submarine, in a war zone, in a meditation retreat, in your
     grandmother's kitchen. We don't care. It's yours.

